   1:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c **** /**
   2:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * @file
   3:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * Dynamic Host Configuration Protocol client
   4:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  *
   5:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * @defgroup dhcp4 DHCPv4
   6:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * @ingroup ip4
   7:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * DHCP (IPv4) related functions
   8:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * This is a DHCP client for the lwIP TCP/IP stack. It aims to conform
   9:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * with RFC 2131 and RFC 2132.
  10:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  *
  11:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * @todo:
  12:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * - Support for interfaces other than Ethernet (SLIP, PPP, ...)
  13:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  *
  14:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * Options:
  15:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * @ref DHCP_COARSE_TIMER_SECS (recommended 60 which is a minute)
  16:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * @ref DHCP_FINE_TIMER_MSECS (recommended 500 which equals TCP coarse timer)
  17:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  *
  18:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * dhcp_start() starts a DHCP client instance which
  19:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * configures the interface by obtaining an IP address lease and maintaining it.
  20:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  *
  21:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * Use dhcp_release() to end the lease and use dhcp_stop()
  22:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * to remove the DHCP client.
  23:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  *
  24:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * @see LWIP_HOOK_DHCP_APPEND_OPTIONS
  25:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * @see LWIP_HOOK_DHCP_PARSE_OPTION
  26:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  *
  27:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * @see netifapi_dhcp4
  28:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  */
  29:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c **** 
