 853:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  *
 854:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * This enters the REBOOTING state to verify that the currently bound
 855:./lwip-2.1.2/src/core/ipv4/dhcp.c ****  * address is still valid.
